# Move the arm to a target location and grasp a cube there (then hold it).
# Request: where to pick up.
# Response: whether a cube was grasped, plus a human-readable message.
string position   # required: where to pick — "x,y" / "x,y,z" (base frame, metres) or a named spot (e.g. "中间")
---
bool ok           # true if the cube was grasped (hand closed on an object)
string message    # human-readable status / error detail
